50:That server hands its startup environment to every window created afterwards, and `NO_COLOR` is n
ot in tmux's default `update-environment` set, so a later client attach does not repair it.
51:Firstmate therefore drops the launcher's color control (`NO_COLOR`, `FORCE_COLOR`, `CLICOLOR`, `C
LICOLOR_FORCE`) before that one `new-session`, so an agent-launched Firstmate cannot leave every cre
w pane monochrome.
